function exportCSV(){const t=trip(),fields=[['firstName','Nombre'],['lastName','Apellido'],['documentType','Tipo documento'],['document','Documento'],['dniCopy','Ejemplar vigente'],['dniCheckedAt','Fecha consulta RENAPER'],['dniSource','Origen ejemplar'],['birthDate','Nacimiento'],['nationality','Nacionalidad'],['phone','Teléfono'],['boarding','Embarque'],['specialDiet','Dieta especial'],['medicationAllergies','Alergias a medicamentos'],['medications','Medicación que toma'],['notes','Observaciones']];const cell=v=>'"'+String(v??'').replace(/^[=+@\-\t\r]/,"'$&").replace(/"/g,'""')+'"';const rows=[['Grupo','Butaca',...fields.map(f=>f[1])],...t.passengers.map(p=>[group(t,p.groupId)?.name||'',p.noSeat?'Sin butaca':seatLabel(t,p.seatId),...fields.map(([k])=>p[k])])];download('pasajeros.csv','\uFEFF'+rows.map(r=>r.map(cell).join(';')).join('\r\n'),'text/csv;charset=utf-8');}
